# Documents critical-path ownership ahead of a future second maintainer
# (see docs/release-ruleset.md, issue #196). `require_code_owner_reviews`
# is deliberately OFF on the main branch ruleset: BeeUI has a single owner
# today, and the sole owner cannot satisfy a review requirement on their
# own pull request. This file exists so ownership is already documented and
# takes effect automatically the day a second maintainer gets write access,
# without another ruleset change.

/packages/            @beobungbu
/.github/workflows/   @beobungbu
/.github/deployment/  @beobungbu
/scripts/             @beobungbu
/registry/            @beobungbu
